1
00:00:00,048 --> 00:00:01,602
Di dinding Grand Canyon,

2
00:00:01,602 --> 00:00:05,958
ada garis batu yang menelan lebih
dari 1 miliar tahun sejarah Bumi!

3
00:00:05,958 --> 00:00:07,016
Di bawahnya,

4
00:00:07,016 --> 00:00:09,952
batu 1,7 miliar tahun...

5
00:00:09,952 --> 00:00:10,801
di atasnya,

6
00:00:10,801 --> 00:00:12,593
cuma 500 juta tahun.

7
00:00:12,593 --> 00:00:14,023
Siapa yang menghapusnya?

8
00:00:14,023 --> 00:00:15,243
Tersangka favoritnya:

9
00:00:15,243 --> 00:00:16,082
gletser,

10
00:00:16,082 --> 00:00:17,579
saat Bumi membeku.

11
00:00:17,579 --> 00:00:21,115
Tapi studi terbaru di jurnal
Nature menunjuk dalang lain...

12
00:00:21,115 --> 00:00:22,202
perut Bumi!

13
00:00:22,202 --> 00:00:24,204
Panasnya mengangkat benua...

14
00:00:24,204 --> 00:00:27,016
lalu hujan dan angin mengikisnya habis.

15
00:00:27,016 --> 00:00:27,645
Follow,

16
00:00:27,645 --> 00:00:29,976
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
